+-\x1b[1m DeviceChain - dcctl install - kind devicechain \x1b[m----------------------------------------------------- dcctl v1.12.0 -+
| \x1b[1mAdvanced settings\x1b[m                                                                                                    |
| Editors change the plan at once and re-run the checks. Every other flag from the command line is carried as given.   |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mImages and developer build\x1b[m                                                                                           |
|   --registry localhost:5000 carried (from the command line)                                                          |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mMonitoring and alerts\x1b[m                                                                                                |
|   Monitoring stack (--no-monitoring): on (default)                                                                   |
|   --alert-webhook configured (hidden) carried (from the command line)                                                |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mDatabase placement, connection budget and WAL\x1b[m                                                                        |
|   --database-toleration dedicated=db:NoSchedule, spot=true:NoSchedule carried (from the command line)                |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mBackups and snapshots\x1b[m                                                                                                |
| > TLS (cert-manager) (--no-tls): \x1b[7mon\x1b[m (default)                                                                        |
|   Database backups: on (follows the bundled CloudNativePG operator and, on Compact, TLS)                             |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mRelational recovery\x1b[m                                                                                                  |
|   nothing set; the defaults apply                                                                                    |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mGateway, MQTT and legacy ingress\x1b[m                                                                                     |
|   nothing set; the defaults apply                                                                                    |
|                                                                                                                      |
| \x1b[1mEscape hatches\x1b[m                                                                                                       |
|   --yes true carried (from the command line)                                                                         |
|                                                                                                                      |
| Preflight: all checks passed.                                                                                        |
